{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>TimeBox Tracker 以簡潔任務隊列配合短時專注，協助使用者為重要事情預留時間；適合想一次只專注一件事、把大計劃拆成小時間盒的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-244.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>前三大任務與限時專注</h2>\n<p>使用者可把任務按優先次序排列，首三項成為專注清單，重要任務可即時移到最前，其餘留在待辦隊列。每項任務可設定 5、15、30、45 或 60 分鐘時間盒，開始後可暫停、繼續或提早結束，系統會記錄已專注時間；完成、保留或再開一節皆可，關閉畫面亦會背景計時。程式另備完成紀錄及 CSV 匯出。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-296-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-297-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-298-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-299-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-300-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：TimeBox Tracker – Do More</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/timebox-tracker-do-more/id6813779954?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T20:00:27.175207+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":311,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T19:39:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T20:37:59.984558+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T19:53:42.664056+00:00","content_hash":"627dc37fd67324adec386c1be36085a85a8ec832ba992dacbd756d3060b545aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}